# Unit23
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 必考词Unit23核心词汇

episode/ˈepɪsoʊd/插曲；一集/The first episode was very popular.
equivalent/ɪˈkwɪvələnt/等同的/One mile is equivalent to 1.6 km.
erode/ɪˈroʊd/侵蚀/The cliff has been eroded by the sea.
evaluate/ɪˈvæljueɪt/评估/We need to evaluate the results.
exaggerate/ɪɡˈzædʒəreɪt/夸大/He tends to exaggerate his achievements.
exception/ɪkˈsepʃn/例外/There are no exceptions to this rule.
excessive/ɪkˈsesɪv/过度的/Excessive drinking is harmful.
exclude/ɪkˈskluːd/排除/The price excludes tax.
execute/ˈeksɪkjuːt/执行/The plan was executed perfectly.
exert/ɪɡˈzɜːrt/施加/He exerted great influence.
exhaust/ɪɡˈzɔːst/使筋疲力尽/The hike exhausted everyone.
exhibit/ɪɡˈzɪbɪt/展览/The museum exhibits rare paintings.
exploit/ɪkˈsplɔɪt/开发/We should exploit renewable energy.
explicit/ɪkˈsplɪsɪt/明确的/The instructions are very explicit.
extract/ɪkˈstrækt/提取/They extracted oil from the ground.
fabric/ˈfæbrɪk/织物/The fabric of society is changing.
facilitate/fəˈsɪlɪteɪt/促进/Technology facilitates communication.
faculty/ˈfækəlti/全体教员/She is a member of the faculty.
fierce/fɪrs/激烈的/Competition for the job is fierce.
flourish/ˈflɜːrɪʃ/繁荣/The business has flourished recently.
fluctuate/ˈflʌktʃueɪt/波动/Prices fluctuate throughout the year.
forbid/fərˈbɪd/禁止/Smoking is forbidden in public areas.
forecast/ˈfɔːrkæst/预测/The forecast predicts rain tomorrow.
forge/fɔːrdʒ/锻造；伪造/He forged a career in music.
forth/fɔːrθ/向前/From that day forth, everything changed.
fossil/ˈfɑːsl/化石/Scientists discovered a new fossil.
framework/ˈfreɪmwɜːrk/框架/We need a legal framework.
franchise/ˈfræntʃaɪz/特许经营权/He bought a franchise.
friction/ˈfrɪkʃn/摩擦/There is friction between departments.
frontier/frʌnˈtɪr/边界；前沿/Space is the final frontier.
frustrate/frʌˈstreɪt/使沮丧/The lack of progress frustrated the team.
furnish/ˈfɜːrnɪʃ/提供/She furnished the apartment.
furthermore/ˌfɜːrðərˈmɔːr/此外/The plan is impractical; furthermore, it is expensive.
genuine/ˈdʒenjuɪn/真正的/This is a genuine diamond ring.
gesture/ˈdʒestʃər/手势/He made a gesture of welcome.
global/ˈɡloʊbl/全球的/Climate change is a global issue.
govern/ˈɡʌvərn/统治/Laws govern how we behave.
gradual/ˈɡrædʒuəl/逐渐的/There has been a gradual improvement.
gravity/ˈɡrævəti/重力；严重性/The gravity of the situation is clear.
guarantee/ˌɡærənˈtiː/保证/The product comes with a guarantee.
halt/hɔːlt/停止/Production was halted due to the strike.
harbor/ˈhɑːrbər/港口/The ship arrived at the harbor.
harmony/ˈhɑːrməni/和谐/We should live in harmony with nature.
harsh/hɑːrʃ/严酷的/The harsh winter made travel difficult.
haunt/hɔːnt/萦绕/The memory haunted him for years.
hinder/ˈhɪndər/阻碍/Bad weather hindered the rescue.
household/ˈhaʊshoʊld/家庭的/Household expenses have increased.
housing/ˈhaʊzɪŋ/住房/The city needs affordable housing.
identical/aɪˈdentɪkl/完全相同的/The two paintings look identical.
ideology/ˌaɪdiˈɑːlədʒi/意识形态/Different parties have different ideologies.
